0 @I14@ INDI
1 NAME Arthur Bell /Nicholls/
2 GIVN Arthur Bell
2 SURN Nicholls
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 JAN 1819
2 PLAC County Antrim, Ireland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 DEC 1906
2 PLAC Banagher, Ireland
1 FAMS @F02@
1 NOTE An Ulsterman from County Antrim, curate at Haworth from 1845. He proposed to Charlotte in December 1852; she refused, her father refused more loudly, and he left the parish. He came back, and they
2 CONC  married in June 1854.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nine months later she was dead. He stayed at Haworth anyway, keeping house for her father until the old man died in 1861, then returned to Ireland, farmed at Banagher, and married again. He outlived
2 CONC  every Brontë by forty-five years.
1 OBJE
2 FORM jpeg
